1
00:00:00,650 --> 00:00:02,280
Watch that sandal.

2
00:00:02,640 --> 00:00:05,230
A soft sandal, right at the step's edge.

3
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:07,630
His mom gets distracted for a moment.

4
00:00:12,190 --> 00:00:14,060
Emergency stop first.

5
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:16,560
Don't pull the sandal.

6
00:00:16,610 --> 00:00:18,720
If the foot is free, slip it out.

7
00:00:18,770 --> 00:00:21,440
If it's trapped, call emergency services.

8
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:26,150
A motor pulls the linked steps.

9
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,950
They turn at the top and
come back underneath.

10
00:00:30,840 --> 00:00:33,830
The step moves, the
skirt panel stays still.

11
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:36,870
A soft sandal can get
caught in this narrow gap.

12
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,730
The system may not detect every jam.

13
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:43,530
Emergency stops are at
the entrance and exit.

14
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:44,810
Know where they are.

15
00:00:46,040 --> 00:00:47,110
Face forward.

16
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:50,510
Stand in the center of the step
and hold your child's hand.

17
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:55,110
There's an emergency stop
button at the entrance and exit.

18
00:00:55,160 --> 00:00:56,310
Do you know where it is?

19
00:00:56,360 --> 00:00:58,310
Comment yes or no.
